-- Quét tìm toàn bộ quái còn sống thuộc bãi trong phạm vi chỉ định (Hỗ trợ Gom quái)
function HuDy.GetSpotMobs(mobName, spotPos, maxRadius)
    maxRadius = maxRadius or 350
    local cleanTarget = string.lower(string.match(mobName, "^(.-)%s*%[") or mobName):match("^%s*(.-)%s*$")
    
    local foldersToSearch = {}
    local monsterFolder = workspace:FindFirstChild("Monster")
    if monsterFolder then
        if monsterFolder:FindFirstChild("Mon") then table.insert(foldersToSearch, monsterFolder.Mon) end
        if monsterFolder:FindFirstChild("Boss") then table.insert(foldersToSearch, monsterFolder.Boss) end
        table.insert(foldersToSearch, monsterFolder)
    end
    local extraFolders = {"SeaMonster", "Boss", "MOB", "Mobs", "Alive", "Enemies"}
    for _, name in ipairs(extraFolders) do
        local f = workspace:FindFirstChild(name)
        if f then table.insert(foldersToSearch, f) end
    end
    
    local spotV3 = (typeof(spotPos) == "CFrame" and spotPos.Position) or (typeof(spotPos) == "Vector3" and spotPos) or nil
    local found = {}
    local seen = {}
    
    for _, f in ipairs(foldersToSearch) do
        if f then
            for _, m in ipairs(f:GetDescendants()) do
                if m:IsA("Model") and not seen[m] then
                    local hum = m:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
                    if hum and hum.Health > 0 then
                        local mBase = string.lower(string.match(string.match(m.Name, "^(.-)%s*%[") or m.Name, "^%s*(.-)%s*$"))
                        if mBase == cleanTarget then
                            local r = m:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart") or m.PrimaryPart or m:FindFirstChild("Torso") or m:FindFirstChild("UpperTorso") or m:FindFirstChild("Head") or m:FindFirstChildWhichIsA("BasePart", true)
                            if r then
                                local dist = spotV3 and (r.Position - spotV3).Magnitude or 0
                                if not spotV3 or dist <= maxRadius then
                                    seen[m] = true
                                    table.insert(found, { Model = m, Root = r, Hum = hum, Dist = dist })
                                end
                            end
                        end
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end
    
    table.sort(found, function(a, b) return a.Dist < b.Dist end)
    return found
end

